{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37724","headline":"次韵和秀上人长安寺居言怀寄渚宫禅者 · 郑谷","name":"次韵和秀上人长安寺居言怀寄渚宫禅者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧斋松老别多年，香社人稀丧乱间。\n出寺秪知趋内殿，闭门长似在深山。\n卧听秦树秋钟断，吟想荆江夕鸟还。\n唯恐兴来飞锡去，老郎无路更追攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}